{% extends "base.html.j2" %}

{% block title %}Still searching for {{ payload.kid_name }}{% endblock %}
{% block heading %}Still searching for activities for {{ payload.kid_name }}{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
<p>We're still on the lookout for activities that match <strong>{{ payload.kid_name }}</strong>.</p>

<p>It's been <strong>{{ payload.days_since_added }} days</strong> since you added them, and we haven't found a strong match yet. We're scanning new schedules as they're posted &mdash; we'll alert you the moment something fits.</p>

<p style="color: #555;">
  In the meantime, you can review and tune {{ payload.kid_name }}'s preferences from the dashboard.
</p>
{% endblock %}
